ي المباشر فوق التطريز."},"visible":true},{"id":"faq-origin","category":{"en":"ORIGIN & CRAFTSMANSHIP","ar":"الأصالة والتصنيع"},"question":{"en":"Where are LAHAB pieces designed, milled, and manufactured?","ar":"أين يتم تصميم وتصنيع وحياكة قطع لَهَب؟"},"answer":{"en":"Every LAHAB piece is conceived in Cairo and crafted from premium long-staple Egyptian cotton in Egyptian textile mills with local embroidery artisans.","ar":"صُممت قطع لَهَب في القاهرة وتُحاك من القطن المصري طويل التيلة في مصانع النسيج المصرية ويُنفذ تطريزها بأيدي حرفيين محليين."},"visible":true},{"id":"faq-sizing","category":{"en":"SIZING & EXCHANGES","ar":"المقاسات والاستبدال"},"question":{"en":"How does the boxy drop-shoulder fit work, and can I exchange sizes?","ar":"كيف تختار مقاسك للقصة العريضة، وما هي سياسة الاستبدال؟"},"answer":{"en":"Choose your standard size for the intended relaxed streetwear drape or size down for a tailored profile. Unworn tagged pieces can be exchanged within 14 days.","ar":"اختر مقاسك المعتاد للقصة العريضة أو مقاساً أصغر لإطلالة أكثر انضباطاً. يمكن استبدال القطع غير المستخدمة خلال 14 يوماً."},"visible":true}]}},{"id":"home-contact","type":"contact","visible":true,"style":{"background":{"kind":"theme","token":"primary"},"paddingTop":"2xl","paddingBottom":"2xl","contentWidth":"wide","textAlign":"center","textColor":{"kind":"theme","token":"text"},"accentColor":{"kind":"theme","token":"accent"},"headingFamily":"heading","headingScale":"xl","headingWeight":"bold"},"content":{"badge":{"en":"ATELIER CONCIERGE & BESPOKE INQUIRIES","ar":"أتيليه لَهَب — خدمة العملاء والطلبات الخاصة"},"title":{"en":"CONNECT WITH THE ATELIER","ar":"تواصل مع الأتيليه"},"description":{"en":"Our atelier concierge is dedicated to assisting you with architectural drape sizing, custom bespoke gold monogramming, and express regional courier tracking.","ar":"فريق أتيليه لَهَب متواجد لخدمتك مباشرة للإجابة على استفسارات المقاسات، طلبات التطريز الخاص بالخيوط الذهبية، أو متابعة التوصيل السريع."},"email":"lahabfire@gmail.com","phoneDisplay":"+20 128 822 4920","whatsappNumber":"201288224920","responseTime":{"en":"Avg. Response: < 2 Hours","ar":"الرد خلال ساعتين بحد أقصى"},"inquiryCategories":[{"id":"contact-bespoke","value":"bespoke","label":{"en":"Bespoke Monogram / Custom Tailoring","ar":"تطريز ذهبي مخصص وتفصيل خاص"}},{"id":"contact-sizing","value":"sizing","label":{"en":"Sizing & Drop-Shoulder Drape Advice","ar":"استشارة المقاس والقصة المعمارية"}},{"id":"contact-order","value":"order","label":{"en":"Order Status & Express Tracking","ar":"متابعة الشحن وحالة الطلب"}},{"id":"contact-drop-two","value":"drop02","label":{"en":"Drop 02 VIP Allocation","ar":"حجز مبكر للإصدار الثاني"}},{"id":"contact-press","value":"press","label":{"en":"Press, Editorial & Partnerships","ar":"الصحافة والتنسيق والتعاون"}},{"id":"contact-general","value":"general","label":{"en":"General Atelier Inquiry","ar":"استفسار عام"}}]}},{"id":"home-footer","type":"footer","visible":true,"style":{"background":{"kind":"theme","token":"surfaceElevated"},"paddingTop":"xl","paddingBottom":"xl","contentWidth":"wide","textAlign":"start","textColor":{"kind":"theme","token":"text"},"accentColor":{"kind":"theme","token":"accent"},"headingFamily":"heading","headingScale":"xl","headingWeight":"bold"},"content":{"brandDescription":{"en":"LAHAB. Contemporary streetwear forged in calligraphic heritage, nocturnal geometry, and heavyweight textile discipline.","ar":"لَهَب. أزياء شارع معاصرة مصهورة في هندسة الخط، ألوان الليل الهادئة، وانضباط النسيج الثقيل."},"navigationHeading":{"en":"NAVIGATION","ar":"التنقل في الموقع"},"links":[{"id":"footer-top-link","label":{"en":"TOP // INTRO","ar":"البداية // المقدمة"},"action":{"type":"scrollToSection","sectionId":"home-hero"}},{"id":"footer-concept-link","label":{"en":"CONCEPT & STORY","ar":"المفهوم والقصة"},"action":{"type":"scrollToSection","sectionId":"home-brand-story"}},{"id":"footer-products-link","label":{"en":"DROP 01 PIECES","ar":"قطع الإصدار الأول"},"action":{"type":"scrollT